  "outcome_taxonomy": {
    "A_GO-SEMANTIC": "pooled gate PASS and within-synthetic gate PASS -- the controller retains prospective ranking signal inside the dominant source stratum, so the pooled enrichment is not merely source routing. The only outcome under which the owner may consider V3-R002 decision-guided RL.",
